    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it does feel like a script. and no matter how much i study it or try to copy people, i can feel the gap every single day. it's like being a different species. it's not even that i want to be \"normal\" anymore, i just want the heaviness to stop. it's just so much work to keep waking up to this.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
